	# Shield textures that mods set from Java code, which TriOS can't read from
	# their files. Same format as the `data/config/trios.json` a mod can ship;
	# this list is just the lowest-priority source, so a mod's own file wins.
	#
	# Every entry below was read out of the mod's compiled code or source, and
	# only covers textures applied unconditionally when a ship is created — the
	# way the ship looks sitting still. Textures a mod swaps in mid-combat, and
	# hullmods players install themselves, are left out on purpose.
	#
	# An entry costs nothing when its mod isn't installed: the texture path
	# doesn't resolve and the entry is dropped.
